analog_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "alarm_TI201_HH", "tag": "TI-201", "high_limit": 100, "priority": "high"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "alarm_TI201_HH"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.alarm_TI201_HH": {"id": "alarm_TI201_HH", "tag": "TI-201", "type": "analog", "high_limit": 100.0, "low_limit": null, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "high", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 1.296399999773712, "intended_entities": ["alarms.alarm_TI201_HH"], "referenced_entities": ["points.TI-201"]}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_digital_alarm", "create_analog_alarm", "set_threshold", "delete_alarm", "disable_alarm", "enable_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_alarms", "action": "create_analog_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "alarm_TI201_LL", "tag": "TI-201", "low_limit": 10, "priority": "high"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "alarm_TI201_LL"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.alarm_TI201_LL": {"id": "alarm_TI201_LL", "tag": "TI-201", "type": "analog", "high_limit": null, "low_limit": 10.0, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "high", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.4957000001013512, "intended_entities": ["alarms.alarm_TI201_LL"], "referenced_entities": ["points.TI-201"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:5c36a73b4c1d2de1572720df5fcdfadf57212e64b3121822dbe294c91f962227", "final_hash": "sha256:c2c6f084ec267c5d8f6b86c605eff94c847bd464cdc720e9489a9404a9fef9ca", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 982, "output_tokens": 158, "latency_ms": 2080.369999999675, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我先查询一下系统中的现有点位，看看 TI-201 是否存在。", "reasoning": "用户想要为TI-201这个点位设置HH（高高位）报警和LL（低低位）报警，阈值分别是100和10，优先级设为high。\n\n当前阶段是ANALYZE_INTENT，可切换的下一阶段包括CONFIG_ALARM等。我需要先了解当前系统中的点位和页面情况。\n\n首先，我需要先查询现有的点位信息，看看TI-201是否存在。同时也可以查看页面信息。\n\n让我先调用list_points来查看现有的点。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 2083, "output_tokens": 580, "latency_ms": 4742.173800001183, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的！系统中已存在 **TI-201** 这个模拟量点位。现在我来为您创建两个独立的报警：\n\n1. **HH Alarm**（高高位报警）：阈值 100，优先级 high\n2. **LL Alarm**（低低位报警）：阈值 10，优先级 high", "reasoning": "系统中已经有一个TI-201的模拟量点位（analog point）。现在我需要为它创建两个模拟量报警（analog alarm）。\n\n不过，用户说的\"HH alarm\" 和 \"LL alarm\" 实际上在SCADA中通常指的是：\n- HH: 高高位报警，即 high_limit\n- LL: 低低位报警，即 low_limit\n\n在create_analog_alarm中，我们可以设置 high_limit 和 low_limit。但通常HH和LL是两个独立的报警，分别有不同的阈值。\n\n不过看工具的参数，create_analog_alarm支持同时设置high_limit和low_limit。但用户说要分别设置HH alarm (100) 和 LL alarm (10)，而且priority都是high。\n\n通常的做法是：\n1. 一个报警用于高限（HH）- high_limit = 100\n2. 一个报警用于低限（LL）- low_limit = 10\n\n可以创建两个独立的报警，也可以创建一个报警同时设置high_limit和low_limit。\n\n考虑到用户说\"一个HH alarm和一个LL alarm\"，意思是两个独立的报警，所以我们创建两个analog alarm：\n1. 创建 alarm_TI201_HH，tag=TI-201，high_limit=100，priority=high\n2. 创建 alarm_TI201_LL，tag=TI-201，low_limit=10，priority=high\n\n这两个调用没有依赖关系，可以同时进行。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 4342, "output_tokens": 301, "latency_ms": 3172.396399999343, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **两个报警已成功创建！** 以下是配置摘要：\n\n| 报警 ID | 监控点位 | 类型 | 阈值 | 优先级 |\n|---------|---------|------|------|-------|\n| **alarm_TI201_HH** | TI-201 | 高高位报警 (HH) | **≥ 100** | 🔴 High |\n| **alarm_TI201_LL** | TI-201 | 低低位报警 (LL) | **≤ 10** | 🔴 High |\n\n### 配置说明\n- 当 **TI-201** 的值 **≥ 100** 时，触发 **HH 报警**\n- 当 **TI-201** 的值 **≤ 10** 时，触发 **LL 报警**\n- 两个报警的优先级均为 **high**，会在报警列表中优先显示\n\n请问您还有其他配置需要处理吗？如果没有，我将结束本次任务。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "两个报警都创建成功了。现在我来总结一下完成情况。\n\n用户的任务是给TI-201设置HH和LL报警。我已经完成了。现在需要告知用户并询问是否需要进入下一阶段，或者结束任务。\n\n根据行为准则第6条：完成任务后必须明确告知用户，并在回复的纯文本中包含 \"next_state: DONE\" 来结束整个任务。\n\n不过，用户可能还有其他需求，先确认是否已完成全部需求。\n\n用户的需求已经满足，所以我可以选择结束。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 7407, "output_tokens": 1039, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 10012.862599998698}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "e7754cc7-afcd-47d8-b457-048d2e505a3b", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:bb4995de5cae2f7449ac1d1884b4915c6af8430c26d385afe8cea8443c6d380f", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-015", "text": "给TI-201 set一个HH alarm和LL alarm，分别在100和10，priority设为high", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "alarm"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T05:13:28.246Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T05:13:39.132Z", "total_turns": 3, "terminal_state": "DONE", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:13:28.247Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:13:30.753Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:13:30.753Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:13:39.132Z"}, {"name": "DONE", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:13:39.132Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:13:39.132Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "points": [{"tag": "TI-201", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.5632000011246419, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_digital_alarm", "create_analog_alarm", "set_threshold", "delete_alarm", "disable_alarm", "enable_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_alarms", "action": "create_analog_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "alarm_TI201_HH", "tag": "TI-201", "high_limit": 100, "priority": "high"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "alarm_TI201_HH"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.alarm_TI201_HH": {"id": "alarm_TI201_HH", "tag": "TI-201", "type": "analog", "high_limit": 100.0, "low_limit": null, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "high", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.706299999365001, "intended_entities": ["alarms.alarm_TI201_HH"], "referenced_entities": ["points.TI-201"]}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_digital_alarm", "create_analog_alarm", "set_threshold", "delete_alarm", "disable_alarm", "enable_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_alarms", "action": "create_analog_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "alarm_TI201_LL", "tag": "TI-201", "low_limit": 10, "priority": "high"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "alarm_TI201_LL"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.alarm_TI201_LL": {"id": "alarm_TI201_LL", "tag": "TI-201", "type": "analog", "high_limit": null, "low_limit": 10.0, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "high", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.5091999992146157, "intended_entities": ["alarms.alarm_TI201_LL"], "referenced_entities": ["points.TI-201"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:5c36a73b4c1d2de1572720df5fcdfadf57212e64b3121822dbe294c91f962227", "final_hash": "sha256:c2c6f084ec267c5d8f6b86c605eff94c847bd464cdc720e9489a9404a9fef9ca", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 982, "output_tokens": 251, "latency_ms": 2504.630699999325, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我先查询一下现有的点位信息，看看 TI-201 是否已经存在。", "reasoning": "用户想给一个点位（TI-201）设置 HH alarm（高高报警）和 LL alarm（低低报警），阈值分别为100和10，优先级设为high。\n\n当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，可切换的下一阶段包括 ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE。\n\n当前 workflow=AlarmConfig, step=discover_points。\n\n当前可用工具只有 manage_pages 和 manage_points，但它们的当前允许 actions 只有 list_pages 和 list_points，没有配置报警的功能。\n\n我需要先看看现有的点位情况，确认 TI-201 是否存在。然后切换到 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段来配置报警。\n\n让我先列出所有点位，看看 TI-201 是否存在。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 2176, "output_tokens": 759, "latency_ms": 6321.710899999744, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "TI-201 点位已存在（analog 类型）。现在进入 **CONFIG_ALARM** 阶段，我来为它创建两个独立的报警：HH（高高报警，阈值 100）和 LL（低低报警，阈值 10），优先级均为 high。", "reasoning": "好的，TI-201 已经存在，是一个 analog 类型的点位。\n\n当前阶段是 CONFIG_ALARM，可用工具是 manage_alarms。我需要为 TI-201 创建两个模拟量报警：\n1. HH alarm - 高高报警，high_limit 为 100\n2. LL alarm - 低低报警，low_limit 为 10\n\n对于模拟量报警，使用 create_analog_alarm 工具。\n\n不过，create_analog_alarm 中只有 high_limit 和 low_limit 参数，没有专门的 \"HH\" 和 \"LL\" 区分。通常在实际 SCADA 系统中，HH 和 LL 是独立的报警。但这里 create_analog_alarm 一次调用可以设置 high_limit 和 low_limit。\n\n但用户说 \"set a HH alarm and LL alarm\"，可能是想要两个独立的报警。不过从工具定义来看，create_analog_alarm 可以同时设置 high_limit 和 low_limit。\n\n但如果是两个独立的报警（比如 alarm_hi 和 alarm_lo），我应该创建两个不同的报警 ID。\n\n嗯，让我想想。用户说\"给TI-201 set一个HH alarm和LL alarm\"，意思是高高报警（阈值100）和低低报警（阈值10）。在 SCADA 中，HH 和 LL 通常分别是高高和低低报警。\n\ncreate_analog_alarm 这个工具可以同时设置 high_limit 和 low_limit。但用户想要两个独立的报警（HH 和 LL），可能应该创建两个独立的报警记录，每个有自己的 ID。\n\n不过，也可以在一个模拟量报警中同时设置 high_limit=100 和 low_limit=10，priority=high。\n\n但考虑到用户明确说\"HH alarm\"和\"LL alarm\"两个，我觉得应该创建两个独立的报警：\n1. 一个 HH alarm（高高报警），设置 high_limit=100\n2. 一个 LL alarm（低低报警），设置 low_limit=10\n\n这样更符合用户意图。\n\n让我创建两个报警：\n1. alarm_TI201_HH: tag=TI-201, high_limit=100, priority=high\n2. alarm_TI201_LL: tag=TI-201, low_limit=10, priority=high\n\n这两个调用没有依赖关系，可以同时进行。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 4614, "output_tokens": 209, "latency_ms": 2042.8107999996428, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "两个报警已成功创建！以下是配置总结：\n\n---\n\n### ✅ 配置完成\n\n| 报警 ID | 点位 | 类型 | 阈值 | 优先级 |\n|---------|------|------|------|--------|\n| **alarm_TI201_HH** | TI-201 | 高高报警 (HH) | **100** | **high** |\n| **alarm_TI201_LL** | TI-201 | 低低报警 (LL) | **10** | **high** |\n\n- ✅ **HH Alarm** — 当 TI-201 的值 ≥ 100 时触发高高报警\n- ✅ **LL Alarm** — 当 TI-201 的值 ≤ 10 时触发低低报警\n- ✅ 两个报警的优先级均设为 **high**\n\n如果还有其他配置需求，请随时告诉我！\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "两个报警都创建成功了。用户的需求已经完成，没有再提出其他要求。我应该告知用户任务完成，并切换到 DONE 状态。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 7772, "output_tokens": 1219, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 10886.114799999632}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "fa994f77-8cfa-4979-9759-72a8d938812f", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:bb4995de5cae2f7449ac1d1884b4915c6af8430c26d385afe8cea8443c6d380f", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-016", "text": "在chemical screen加个tank，绑到TI-201上，另外加个button用于start", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "graphics"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T05:13:30.408Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T05:14:09.449Z", "total_turns": 6, "terminal_state": "DONE", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "MANAGE_PAGES", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:13:30.408Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:13:31.876Z"}, {"name": "GENERATE_LAYOUT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:13:31.876Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:13:55.241Z"}, {"name": "BIND_POINTS", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:13:55.241Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:14:09.449Z"}, {"name": "DONE", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:14:09.449Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:14:09.449Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "MANAGE_PAGES", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["create_widget", "create_page", "list_pages"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "pages": [{"id": "chem_screen", "name": "chemical screen"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.6409999987226911, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "GENERATE_LAYOUT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_graphics", "allowed_actions": ["create_text", "create_line", "group_widgets", "set_widget_style", "apply_flow_layout"]}, {"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_graphics", "action": "creat