g_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "alarm_PT_COMP_01_H", "tag": "PT_COMP_01", "high_limit": 2.8, "priority": "medium"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "alarm_PT_COMP_01_H"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.alarm_PT_COMP_01_H": {"id": "alarm_PT_COMP_01_H", "tag": "PT_COMP_01", "type": "analog", "high_limit": 2.8, "low_limit": null, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "medium", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.6831000009697163, "intended_entities": ["alarms.alarm_PT_COMP_01_H"], "referenced_entities": ["points.PT_COMP_01"]}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_analog_alarm", "create_digital_alarm", "set_threshold", "disable_alarm", "enable_alarm", "delete_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_alarms", "action": "create_analog_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "alarm_PT_COMP_01_HH", "tag": "PT_COMP_01", "high_limit": 3.2, "priority": "high"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "alarm_PT_COMP_01_HH"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.alarm_PT_COMP_01_HH": {"id": "alarm_PT_COMP_01_HH", "tag": "PT_COMP_01", "type": "analog", "high_limit": 3.2, "low_limit": null, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "high", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.4388999986986164, "intended_entities": ["alarms.alarm_PT_COMP_01_HH"], "referenced_entities": ["points.PT_COMP_01"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:576dd46c892d0c478ef4b7488319f2e1c34a7300eb6d42b30de204ee1da452a3", "final_hash": "sha256:dafd917d1b1d6f1d93dcd88a6e239e2b7cc3b9fe6307cc0986c63c57648c907c", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 986, "output_tokens": 137, "latency_ms": 1971.4327000001504, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我先查询系统中的现有点位，确认 `PT_COMP_01` 是否存在及其类型信息。", "reasoning": "用户想为PT_COMP_01配置报警（H和HH），但当前阶段是ANALYZE_INTENT，可用工具只有manage_pages（list_pages）和manage_points（list_points）。我需要先了解当前系统中是否有PT_COMP_01这个点，以及它的相关信息。\n\n让我先列出所有点位，看看PT_COMP_01是否存在。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 2068, "output_tokens": 524, "latency_ms": 4651.551999999356, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的！`PT_COMP_01` 是一个模拟量点（单位：MPa），适合创建模拟量报警。我现在为它分别创建 **H（高报）**和 **HH（高高报）**两个报警。", "reasoning": "好的，`PT_COMP_01` 是一个模拟量点（analog），单位是 MPa。用户需要配置两个报警：\n\n1. **H (High) 报警**：阈值 = 2.8，优先级 = medium\n2. **HH (High-High) 报警**：阈值 = 3.2，优先级 = high\n\n在 `create_analog_alarm` 中，每个报警有一个 `id`、`tag`、`high_limit`、`low_limit`、`deadband`、`priority`。\n\n一个模拟报警可以同时设高限和低限，但用户要的是两个独立的报警（H 和 HH），所以需要创建两个独立的报警。\n\n让我创建两个模拟量报警：\n\n1. 报警ID: `alarm_PT_COMP_01_H`，tag=`PT_COMP_01`，high_limit=2.8，priority=medium\n2. 报警ID: `alarm_PT_COMP_01_HH`，tag=`PT_COMP_01`，high_limit=3.2，priority=high\n\n这两个报警没有依赖关系，可以同时创建。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 4035, "output_tokens": 232, "latency_ms": 3101.5511999994487, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "两个报警均已成功创建！以下是配置汇总：\n\n---\n\n### ✅ 报警配置完成\n\n| 报警 | 报警ID | 点位 | 阈值 (MPa) | 优先级 |\n|------|--------|------|-----------|--------|\n| **H (高报)** | `alarm_PT_COMP_01_H` | `PT_COMP_01` | **2.8** | 🔶 medium |\n| **HH (高高报)** | `alarm_PT_COMP_01_HH` | `PT_COMP_01` | **3.2** | 🔴 high |\n\n- **H 报警**：当 `PT_COMP_01 ≥ 2.8 MPa` 时触发，优先级 medium\n- **HH 报警**：当 `PT_COMP_01 ≥ 3.2 MPa` 时触发，优先级 high\n\n如需进一步配置通知规则（如短信/邮件推送）或绑定到 HMI 页面，我可以继续协助您。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "两个报警都创建成功了。现在用户的需求已经完成，我需要在回复中告知用户，并切换到DONE状态。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 7089, "output_tokens": 893, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 9736.194200000682}, "judge": null}
